Package: EconR
Type: Package
Title: Consistent Econometric Models with Model-Specific Missing-Data Handling
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: person('David', 'Bustamante', role = c('aut','cre'), email = 'david@example.com')
Description: A consistent interface for econometric estimation with model-specific missing-data handling. Implements ordinary and weighted least squares (OLS/WLS), binary Logit and Probit models, heteroskedasticity-consistent and cluster-robust covariance estimation, and standard model methods for inference, prediction, diagnostics, and model augmentation.
